description	"Sith Trooper Commando

Sith trained in flanking and infiltration tactics who utilize unorthodox techniques and weapons.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% Faster RoF
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Vibrosaber
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 15% faster Movement
> Vibroswords (Dual)
> Vibrosword (Cyan/Blue)
- Sith Heavy Blaster Pistol (Mando Pistol 1)
-- Mag Reload
-- 20%+ Damage, 40%- RoF, 15%+ Velocity
-- 15% Faster Movement

^8Attributes:
- 5% Less KB Taken
- 15% Faster Hack Rate
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (0)
- Assemble (2) 
- Dexterity (1)
- Quickthrow (1)

^3Abilities:
- Combat Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS4]"